         (topic task-freshness)
         (summary "A task's priority number does not stay trustworthy forever just because it was true when written. created/last-validated/status are separate fields from priority -- freshness (FRESH/REVIEW/STALE/UNKNOWN) is computed from last-validated, never from created, and never mathematically raises or lowers the stored priority. A stale P0 means 'verify this is still true,' not 'do it first.' No backfill on old tasks -- last-validated fills in the first time an agent actually revalidates that specific task. | Число priority задачі не лишається надійним вічно лише тому, що колись було правильним. created/last-validated/status -- окремі поля від priority; freshness (FRESH/REVIEW/STALE/UNKNOWN) рахується від last-validated, ніколи від created, і ніколи математично не підвищує чи не знижує збережений priority. Застарілий P0 означає 'перевір, чи це ще правда', а не 'роби першим'. Без backfill старих задач -- last-validated заповнюється, коли агент реально ревалідує саме цю задачу.")
         (authority (../ecosystem/docs/sessions/TASK-FRESHNESS-NOT-PRIORITY-DECAY-2026-09-01.md))
         (how-to (add-created-and-last-validated-to-new-tasks classify-freshness-by-hand-from-last-validated-until-a-primitive-exists never-backfill-old-tasks-in-bulk))
         (verify (freshness-thresholds-3-and-7-days status-distinct-from-existing-done-field))
         (lifecycle proposal)
         (provenance "ecosystem 2026-09-01: owner design decision, triggered by this session's tasks.my sync work and the GUARD PASS finding a task whose literal description was already stale")
         (unknown-route ask-owner))
      (reference
         (topic swarm-peer-addressing)
         (summary "A swarm-node has three genuinely different addresses that were previously conflated into one: bind (the socket it listens on), advertise (the address it tells peers to use), and observed (the address a peer sees a connection arrive FROM). Conflating them breaks same-machine gossip discovery once a peer's address gets relayed through a remote seed hop -- the observed address becomes the seed's view (e.g. the machine's own Tailscale IP) instead of 127.0.0.1, so same-machine peers become mutually unreachable even though both are alive. Fix: explicit --advertise-host, carried in peer-hello/peer-welcome, wins over the observed socket IP when present; wildcard (0.0.0.0) bind now fails closed without it; falls back to the observed IP for backward compat with any live peer still on the old binary. | У swarm-node насправді три різні адреси, які раніше змішувалися в одну: bind (сокет, на якому слухає), advertise (адреса, яку каже використовувати пірам), observed (адреса, з якої пір бачить вхідне з'єднання). Змішування ламає gossip-discovery на одній машині, щойно адреса пройшла через remote-seed hop -- observed стає поглядом seed (напр. власна Tailscale IP машини) замість 127.0.0.1, тож живі піри на одній машині стають взаємно недосяжні. Фікс: явний --advertise-host, переданий у peer-hello/peer-welcome, перемагає observed socket IP коли присутній; wildcard (0.0.0.0) bind тепер fail-closed без нього; fallback на observed IP для backward-compat зі старим бінарником.")
         (authority (crates/swarm-node/src/main.rs ../ecosystem/docs/wsm-fs/WSM-TRAJECTORY-SYNTHESIS-2026-09-01.md))
         (how-to (set-advertise-host-explicitly-when-binding-non-loopback expect-wildcard-bind-to-fail-closed-without-it fall-back-to-observed-ip-only-for-old-peers))
         (verify (gossip_relays_advertised_address_not_the_observed_socket_ip gossip_falls_back_to_observed_ip_when_peer_omits_advertise_host startup_rejects_wildcard_bind_without_advertise_host))
         (lifecycle current-contract)
         (provenance "my-lisp commit d79b04b + docs correction 2a31e8b, 2026-09-01: owner-diagnosed via live inspection of a stalled node's stdout.log showing continuous connection-refused to the machine's own Tailscale IP, cross-referenced with ip-addr-show -- fix ships in source/tests only, no live process restarted")
         (unknown-route ask-agent))
      (reference
         (topic swarm-push-event-delivery)
         (summary "event-created != send-attempted != socket-write-ok != peer-accepted != mesh-converged. write_all() succeeding only proves bytes reached the local kernel send buffer, not that any peer received or journaled the event -- the server previously told the emitting client 'ok' the instant the event hit its OWN local journal, before broadcast to peers even ran, so a peer that silently never received or acked an event was indistinguishable from one that had. Fix: receiver sends an explicit (event-ack (id ID)) once the event is confirmed in its own journal; sender tracks pending_acks per (peer,event) from the broadcast write-success list; a heartbeat sweep moves anything unacked past ACK_TIMEOUT into a bounded recent_delivery_failures ring instead of letting it silently vanish; queryable via the new (delivery-status) client op. Deliberately minimal -- no retry queue, no backoff, no dedup beyond the existing journal-based idempotency. | event-created != send-attempted != socket-write-ok != peer-accepted != mesh-converged. Успішний write_all() доводить лише, що байти дійшли до локального kernel send buffer, а не що якийсь пір отримав чи зажурналив подію -- сервер раніше казав клієнту 'ok' в момент, коли подія потрапляла лише в ЙОГО ВЛАСНИЙ локальний журнал, до того як broadcast до пірів взагалі відбувся. Фікс: отримувач шле явний (event-ack (id ID)) після підтвердження у власному журналі; відправник тримає pending_acks по (peer,event) зі списку успішних broadcast-записів; heartbeat sweep переносить усе неpідтверджене після ACK_TIMEOUT у обмежений recent_delivery_failures ring, замість мовчазного зникнення; запитується через новий client op (delivery-status). Свідомо мінімально -- без retry-черги, без backoff, без dedup понад наявну journal-based ідемпотентність.")
         (authority (crates/swarm-node/src/main.rs ../ecosystem/plans/tasks.my))
         (how-to (query-delivery-status-after-emit-instead-of-trusting-the-immediate-ok treat-anything-in-recent-delivery-failures-as-actually-failed dont-conflate-with-sync-tasks-or-seed-connection-instability))
         (verify (silent_peer_delivery_never_silently_counts_as_acked event-ack-sent-only-after-own-journal-confirms pending_acks-populated-from-broadcast-write-success-list))
         (lifecycle current-contract)
         (provenance "my-lisp commit 5f32a75, ecosystem 28bb231, 2026-09-01: owner-scoped fix, deliberately not mixed with sync-tasks/Git-vs-swarm-state gap -- SWARM-SEED-CONNECTION-INSTABILITY (why the seed connection itself cycles closed roughly every 25s) remains a separate, unresolved root cause -- this topic covers the SILENT half of the loss only")
         (unknown-route ask-agent))
      (reference
         (topic crashed-agent-session-reconciliation)
         (summary "A live agent's session can die mid-task and leave coherent, non-destructive, but uncommitted work sitting in the shared working tree indefinitely -- a self-registration line, durable-inbox/comms-log entries its own tooling already generated. Don't default to 'not mine, left it alone': cross-reference .agents/sessions.json against what's actually still running to distinguish a genuinely dead session's orphaned output from another agent's still-active uncommitted work, then commit only the coherent, additive, non-destructive pieces (append-only logs, additive JSON/registration lines) on the crashed agent's behalf -- never silently discard it, and never fold it into an unrelated commit without saying whose work it actually was. | Сесія живого агента може вмерти посеред задачі й лишити узгоджену, неруйнівну, але незакомічену роботу в спільному робочому дереві -- рядок саморєестрації, записи durable-inbox/comms-log, які його ж інструментарій вже згенерував. Не варто за замовчуванням 'не моє, не чіпав': звір .agents/sessions.json з тим, що реально ще працює, щоб відрізнити осиротілий вивід дійсно мертвої сесії від активної незакомiченої роботи іншого агента, потім закомить лише узгоджені, додаткові, неруйнівні частини (append-only логи, додаткові JSON/реєстрація) від імені впалого агента -- ніколи не викидай мовчки і ніколи не змішуй з чужим незв'язаним комітом без чіткого атрибутування.")
         (authority (../ecosystem/AGENTS.md ../ecosystem/.agents/sessions.json ../ecosystem/comms-log.md))
         (how-to (cross-reference-sessions-json-against-live-processes distinguish-dead-session-from-active-agent stage-only-coherent-additive-non-destructive-pieces attribute-the-commit-to-whose-work-it-actually-was))
         (verify (sessions-json-entry-with-no-corresponding-live-process append-only-or-purely-additive-diff-confirmed-before-staging))
         (lifecycle current-contract)
         (provenance "ecosystem commits bb867c4 ae8a782, 2026-09-01: Kriyā the Antigravity-IDE agent registered itself in memory/OWNER-PROFILE.md and .agents/sessions.json, plus an LSP-plugin config and a durable-inbox backlog from several other concurrently active agents, then its session ended before any of it was committed -- reconciled and committed on Kriyā's behalf once confirmed dead, owner-directed to fix it since the session had died")
         (unknown-route ask-agent)))))

; Curated frequently-used tools. A record is navigation, not permission to run
; the command. `risk` and `verify` tell an agent what must be checked afterward.
; Добірка часто вживаних інструментів. Запис є навігацією, а не дозволом на
; запуск. Поля `risk` і `verify` пояснюють потрібний доказ після команди.
(def *guard-script-directory*
  (quote
    ((tool
       (name oracle-check)
       (summary "Безпечна перевірка синтаксису WSM без виконання · Parse-only WSM preflight without evaluation")
       (path "target/release/my-lisp")
       (invoke "/home/agents/GitHub/my-lisp/target/release/my-lisp --oracle-check <file|->")
       (risk read-only)
       (verify (exit-0-valid exit-2-structured-error rerun-after-edit)))
     (tool
       (name oracle-local-release)
       (summary "Запустити локальний release Oracle · Start the local release Oracle")
       (path "scripts/start-local-oracle-release.sh")
       (invoke "bash /home/agents/GitHub/my-lisp/scripts/start-local-oracle-release.sh")
       (risk local-service)
       (verify (loopback-listener release-executable contract-version kernel-utc-probe probe pid-metadata)))
     (tool
       (name oracle-local-release-stop)
       (summary "Зупинити локальний release Oracle · Stop the local release Oracle")
       (path "scripts/stop-local-oracle-release.sh")
       (invoke "bash /home/agents/GitHub/my-lisp/scripts/stop-local-oracle-release.sh")
       (risk local-service)
       (verify (pid-validated process-stopped-pidfile-removed)))
     (tool
       (name oracle-time-compare)
       (summary "Паралельно порівняти UTC двох Oracle · Compare UTC observations from two Oracles")
       (path "scripts/compare-oracle-time.py")
       (invoke "python3 /home/agents/GitHub/my-lisp/scripts/compare-oracle-time.py --local 127.0.0.1:9999 --remote 100.113.68.50:9999 --samples 5")
       (risk network-observation)
       (verify (ntp-sync-optional wait-confirmed parallel-samples baseline-offset-ns rtt-ns uncertainty-ns status-observed)))
     (tool
       (name guard-reference)
       (summary "Зберегти нову відповідь як pending-review candidate · Preserve a new answer as a review candidate")
       (path "target/release/guard-reference")
       (invoke "/home/agents/GitHub/my-lisp/target/release/guard-reference propose --inbox ABS --topic T --question Q --answer A --source S --route ROUTE --evidence E")
       (risk append-only)
       (verify (candidate-record status-pending-review provenance)))
     (tool
       (name agent-send)
       (summary "Довговічне повідомлення агенту з окремим wakeup · Durable agent message followed by a separate wakeup")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/agent-send")
       (invoke "/home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/agent-send send --from AGENT --to TARGET --kind KIND MESSAGE")
       (risk writes-coordination-log)
       (verify (admitted inbox-id wakeup-result)))
     (tool
       (name agent-inbox)
       (summary "Прочитати й підтвердити durable inbox · Read and acknowledge the durable inbox")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/agent-inbox")
       (invoke "/home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/agent-inbox read --agent AGENT; /home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/agent-inbox ack --agent AGENT --message ID")
       (risk updates-ack-status)
       (verify (message-id acknowledged)))
     (tool
       (name resource-preflight)
       (summary "Перевірити load, RAM, disk і GPU перед важкою роботою · Check load, RAM, disk, and GPU before heavy work")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/preflight.sh")
       (invoke "bash /home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/preflight.sh [max-load]")
       (risk read-only)
       (verify (exit-0-go exit-1-wait)))
     (tool
       (name bilingual-docs-check)
       (summary "Перевірити український відповідник змінених людських документів · Check Ukrainian coverage for changed human documentation")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/check-bilingual-docs")
       (invoke "/home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/check-bilingual-docs [files...]")
       (risk read-only)
       (verify (exit-0-covered english-only-report)))
     (tool
       (name version-drift-check)
       (summary "Знайти cross-repo розбіжності версій контрактів · Detect cross-repository contract-version drift")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/check-cross-repo-version-drift.py")
       (invoke "python3 /home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/check-cross-repo-version-drift.py --root /home/agents/GitHub")
       (risk read-only)
       (verify (exit-0-no-drift drift-rows-reviewed)))
     (tool
       (name duplicate-task-check)
       (summary "Знайти лише кандидатів на дублікати task IDs · Find advisory near-duplicate task candidates")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/check-near-duplicate-task-ids.py")
       (invoke "python3 /home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/check-near-duplicate-task-ids.py [task-state-dump]")
       (risk read-only-advisory)
       (verify (candidates-domain-reviewed no-auto-merge)))
     (tool
       (name conformance-check)
       (summary "Прогнати незалежного TCP witness мовного контракту · Run the independent TCP language-contract witness")
       (path "../ecosystem/scripts/conformance-check.py")
       (invoke "python3 /home/agents/ecosystem/scripts/conformance-check.py [host:port]")
       (risk bounded-test-run)
       (verify (oracle-revision fixture-count exit-status))))))

(def guard-script-find
  (lambda (name tools)
    (cond
      ((atom tools) (quote ()))
      ((eq (guard-reference-field (quote name) (car tools)) name) (car tools))
      (t (guard-script-find name (cdr tools))))))

(def guard-script
  (lambda (name)
    (let ((tool (guard-script-find name *guard-script-directory*)))
      (cond
        ((atom tool)
         (list
           (quote tool-missing)
           (list (quote name) name)
           (list (quote decision) (quote unknown))
           (list (quote unknown-routes) (guard-unknown-routes))))
        (t tool)))))

(def guard-scripts
  (lambda (tools)
    (cond
      ((atom tools) (quote ()))
      (t (cons (guard-reference-field (quote name) (car tools))
               (guard-scripts (cdr tools)))))))

(def guard-reference-find
  (lambda (topic references)
    (cond
      ((atom references) (quote ()))
      ((eq (guard-reference-field (quote topic) (car references)) topic)
       (car references))
      (t (guard-reference-find topic (cdr references))))))

(def guard-reference
  (lambda (topic)
    (let ((reference (guard-reference-find topic *guard-reference-directory*)))
      (cond
        ((atom reference)
         (list
           (quote reference-missing)
           (list (quote schema) (quote guard-reference/1))
           (list (quote topic) topic)
           (list (quote decision) (quote unknown))
           (list (quote evidence-status) (quote unresolved))
           (list (quote guidance) (quote choose-unknown-route))
           (list (quote unknown-routes) (guard-unknown-routes))))
        (t reference)))))

(def guard-explain
  (lambda (topic)
    (guard-reference-field (quote summary) (guard-reference topic))))

(def guard-how-to
  (lambda (topic)
    (guard-reference-field (quote how-to) (guard-reference topic))))

(def guard-authority
  (lambda (topic)
    (guard-reference-field (quote authority) (guard-reference topic))))

(def guard-verify
  (lambda (topic)
    (guard-reference-field (quote verify) (guard-reference topic))))

(def guard-topics
  (lambda (references)
    (cond
      ((atom references) (quote ()))
      (t
       (cons
         (guard-reference-field (quote topic) (car references))
         (guard-topics (cdr references)))))))

; One canonical entry point for a cold agent: "ask Guard" without needing
; to know whether the answer lives in the tool directory or the reference
; directory. Never silently prefers one over the other -- a name present
; in both comes back tagged `ambiguous` with both full entries, so the
; caller decides, instead of Guard guessing for them.
; Єдина канонічна точка входу для холодного агента: "спитати Guard", не
; знаючи наперед, чи відповідь лежить у директорії інструментів, чи в
; довідковій директорії. Ніколи мовчки не надає перевагу одному з них --
; ім'я, знайдене в обох, повертається позначеним `ambiguous` з обома
; повними записами, і вибір лишається за викликачем.
(def guard-ask
  (lambda (name)
    (let* ((tool (guard-script-find name *guard-script-directory*))
           (reference (guard-reference-find name *guard-reference-directory*)))
      (cond
        ((atom tool)
         (cond
           ((atom reference)
            (list (quote not-found)
                  (list (quote query) name)
                  (list (quote decision) (quote unknown))
                  (list (quote unknown-routes) (guard-unknown-routes))))
           (t
            (list (quote result)
                  (list (quote type) (quote reference-topic))
                  (list (quote source) (quote knowledge/guard-reference.wsm))
                  (list (quote entry) reference)))))
        (t
         (cond
           ((atom reference)
            (list (quote result)
                  (list (quote type) (quote tool))
                  (list (quote source) (quote guard-script-directory))
                  (list (quote entry) tool)))
           (t
            (list (quote ambiguous)
                  (list (quote query) name)
                  (list (quote tool) tool)
                  (list (quote reference-topic) reference)))))))))
